1.14.1 Release notes (2026-09-30)
================================

Improvements to the 'RingPublishingTracking' module.

### Changes

* Content identifier reported in the 'RDLCN' parameter as 'object.id'
    - taken from 'contentId' of 'ContentMetadata' and lowercased the same way as 'PU', so it equals the 'PU' of page view, effective page view and keep alive events
    - also sent with paid events, which report no 'PU'
    - omitted when the content identifier is empty, 'publication' and 'source' are unchanged
